==Battleground==
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 5~15 seconds<sup>150f~450f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 5~15 seconds<sup>150f~450f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 15~45 seconds<sup>450f~1,350f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 15~45 seconds<sup>450f~1,350f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**5 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main goal to achieve here is to figure out a way to chip the dual menace of Le'noir and Angelic Sleipnir. The peon waves of Angels and Darks are easily accomplished by spamming meatshields and Area Attackers like [[Drama Cats]], [[Pizza Cat]] and [[Housewife Cat]], so use the rest of your slots to add in rushers like [[Fishman Cat]] or [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] as well as backliner units like [[Crazed Dragon Cat]].

